%% NovaBank Digital — serverless MVP (logical view; not an IAM/network trust diagram)
flowchart LR
  user([Customer / Reviewer browser]) -->|HTTPS| cf[CloudFront + OAC<br/>security headers]
  cf --> s3site[(S3 private<br/>frontend bucket)]
  user -->|OAuth 2.0 code + PKCE| cog[Cognito user pool<br/>MFA · groups · scopes]
  user -->|HTTPS + access token| api[API Gateway HTTP API<br/>JWT authorizer · throttling]
  api --> cust[customer λ]
  api --> acct[account λ]
  api --> trf[transfer λ]
  api --> frd[fraud λ<br/>admin alerts]
  api --> aud[audit λ<br/>admin reports]
  api --> ntf[notification λ]
  acct -- invoke --> led[ledger λ<br/>ONLY writer of balances]
  trf -- invoke --> frd
  trf -- invoke --> acct
  trf -- invoke --> led
  subgraph ddb[DynamoDB on-demand]
    tC[(customers)]:::t
    tA[(accounts)]:::t
    tL[(ledger)]:::t
    tT[(transactions)]:::t
    tI[(idempotency)]:::t
    tF[(fraud)]:::t
    tO[(outbox<br/>stream)]:::t
    tN[(notifications)]:::t
    tU[(audit)]:::t
  end
  cust --> tC
  acct --> tA
  led --> tL & tI & tO
  led -. state guard .-> tT
  trf --> tT & tI
  frd --> tF
  tO -->|DynamoDB Streams| pub[outbox-publisher λ]
  pub --> eb{{EventBridge bus<br/>+ archive}}
  eb --> qn[[SQS notification + DLQ]] --> ntf
  eb --> qa[[SQS audit + DLQ]] --> aud
  ntf --> tN
  ntf -->|fraud alerts| sns[[SNS ops]]
  aud --> tU
  aud --> ev[(S3 evidence<br/>versioned · SSE-KMS)]
  sched[EventBridge schedules] --> orec[outbox-reconciliation λ] --> eb
  sched --> lrec[ledger-reconciliation λ] --> ev
  cw[CloudWatch logs · EMF metrics · alarms · dashboard · X-Ray] -.-> sns
